edits_description = "The people and stalls were cut out to be used in a composition."
blurb = "Like the rest of the series, this print depicts famous theatrical characters comically reimagined at a market.

The Bush Warbler Sweet being mentioned (uguisu mochi) is a sweet and soft rice cake dusted with green roasted soybean flour (kinako). The shape and color are meant to resemble the Japanese bush warbler (uguisu), a bird associated with the arrival of spring. The shop selling these is in the top right of the image."
